OL,3,AUS pressures Europe to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he may ask
OL,7,FEuropean countries to release some of
OL,8,Ftheir diesel reserves as he considers
OL,9,Fbanning US exports of the fuel.
OL,11,FHis comment comes after diesel prices
OL,12,Fhit record highs on UK forecourts this
OL,13,Fweek, as the Iran war puts pressure on
OL,14,Fthe supply of refined fuels.
OL,16,FThe UK is heavily reliant on imported
OL,17,Fdiesel from the US. But with US voters
OL,18,Falso facing higher fuel costs ahead of
OL,19,Fthe midterm elections in November,
OL,20,FTrump has threatened to restrict diesel
OL,21,Fexports.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
