OL,3,AUS pressures Europe to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent has
OL,7,Furged Europe to get ready to release
OL,8,Fdiesel supplies immediately, arguing
OL,9,Fthat US farmers, truckers, and
OL,10,Fbusinesses "should not be left carrying
OL,11,Fthe burden" as prices soar.
